'''Abalone Cliffs''' are cliffs located in [[The Great Conch]]. The cliffs are inhabited by [[eagle|eagles]], [[Scorpion#Level_1|tiny scorpions]], and [[Snake (Varlamore)|snakes]]. Additionally, [[Orange salamander (Hunter)|orange salamanders]] can be hunted here.

==Trivia==
* Despite its name, {{wp|abalone}} are not found in the area, as they do not exist at all in the game's files.

